[{"title":"葛岭新居","author":"张雨","text":"葛洪川上有馀地，善和里中无故书。\n为惜人间秋水观，鸡鸣犬吠又移居。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10022,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"台掾萨天锡求识予面而之燕南八月十四夜风雨宿菌阁绝句七首明日追寄之 其一","author":"张雨","text":"李公求识少陵面，未闻草堂三日留。\n看君用意古人上，却愧无言与献酬。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10023,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"台掾萨天锡求识予面而之燕南八月十四夜风雨宿菌阁绝句七首明日追寄之 其二","author":"张雨","text":"鹤台道民掩柴扃，雁门才子宿寒厅。\n恰有金华一樽酒，且置茅家双玉瓶。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10024,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"台掾萨天锡求识予面而之燕南八月十四夜风雨宿菌阁绝句七首明日追寄之 其三","author":"张雨","text":"巡官畏虎盛前呵，惊动燕山萨照磨。\n剪烛对床诗未稳，从渠醉尉问谁何。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10025,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"台掾萨天锡求识予面而之燕南八月十四夜风雨宿菌阁绝句七首明日追寄之 其四","author":"张雨","text":"物华年鬓两骎骎，忆别何堪动此心。\n乔木万株天一握，菌巢独自看秋阴。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10026,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"台掾萨天锡求识予面而之燕南八月十四夜风雨宿菌阁绝句七首明日追寄之 其五","author":"张雨","text":"高情常爱白云多，云为漫山雨注河。\n野人宁知御史雨，秪见石田苏晚禾。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10027,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"台掾萨天锡求识予面而之燕南八月十四夜风雨宿菌阁绝句七首明日追寄之 其六","author":"张雨","text":"走送蒲衣庵外路，归时望见赤山湖。\n林子求看换鹅帖，胡郎传送捕鱼图。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10028,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"台掾萨天锡求识予面而之燕南八月十四夜风雨宿菌阁绝句七首明日追寄之 其七","author":"张雨","text":"内台最近燕南幕，博士台郎有此除。\n山泽何当大人赋，寄声多谢马相如。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10029,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"缉熙殿御制墨梅诗帖","author":"张雨","text":"宣和妙赏缁衣句，传在夷门作胜谈。\n行殿春风四十载，玉妃终老向江南。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10030,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"王子明求题高侍郎雨竹","author":"张雨","text":"雨立修篁似戟枝，墨君留影故僛僛。\n房山秪忆巴山夜，及见官奴把烛时。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10031,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"楼居春晓望玄圃","author":"张雨","text":"子晋新宫倚太霞，绕湖烟火万人家。\n观台一面无人处，日出烟消都是花。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10032,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"四贤帖","author":"张雨","text":"四明狂客已乘云，海内文章有二君。\n可惜戴华刘伯寿，只今零落凤凰群。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10033,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"月夕爱南窗竹影","author":"张雨","text":"两丛小竹南窗下，露叶风枝共秋夕。\n月明见影忽自笑，移得王淮凤翔壁。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10034,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"李士行枯木","author":"张雨","text":"两株苍柏如蓬首，皮毛剥落心不朽。\n曾见春风春雨来，相看唤作忘年友。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10035,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"仙山楼观图为马仲礼作","author":"张雨","text":"忆共能书蔡少霞，良常洞口看桃花。\n人间诗酒耽迷了，三百年来不到家。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10036,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"张公甫铁山隐居图","author":"张雨","text":"铁山曾照铁衣寒，南渡功名有足观。\n不见元丰全盛日，钱镠孙子已黄冠。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10037,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"隐居图","author":"张雨","text":"壶浆相饷过溪东，缟袂青裙笑语中。\n何必桃源寻旧路，太平閒作祝鸡翁。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10038,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赵魏公写生梨花折枝","author":"张雨","text":"玉面浑无獭髓痕，春风洗绿上飞裙。\n遥知姑射山头雪，化作杨君梦里云。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10039,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"张仲敏钩勒风林","author":"张雨","text":"墨君神骏出洋州，形似无如老蓟邱。\n可惜风林半窗月，试凭老眼为双钩。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10040,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"鹤山书院","author":"张雨","text":"寂寂茅堂掩昼门，藤阴花气小池浑。\n也知建邺青精饭，不到临邛白发孙。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10041,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"觉林院","author":"张雨","text":"石湖园中数株石，堆向觉林僧子家。\n眼前醒醉若无语，领客绕庭唯看花。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10042,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"归自雨中写况寄景修博士","author":"张雨","text":"蛙处水连围屋草，鸠时雨烂覆檐花。\n移过书窗金鹊尾，秪言浑似野人家。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10043,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"葛岭柬乐閒高士并寄公文道弟","author":"张雨","text":"葛洪井上访贞居，一饮甘泉足自如。\n拂袖莫嫌狂散甚，子非知我我知鱼。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10044,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵实喇卜郎中题襄阳官舍","author":"张雨","text":"岘山日落春风起，竹坞湘桃零乱开。\n倒著接䍦驮瘦马，无人知道使君来。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10045,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"葛岭杂书","author":"张雨","text":"小娃小艇无踪迹，只有荷花雨溅裙。\n净洗一方天水碧，不教歌板污游云。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10046,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"仲敬画华阳草堂图","author":"张雨","text":"珠树风来学凤鸣，玉泉雨过作琴声。\n识得良常洞中路，前生我本山玄卿。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10047,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"遵道竹枝","author":"张雨","text":"筼筜谷口白云生，云里琅玕万玉声。\n惊破幽人春枕梦，一窗斜月半梢横。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10048,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"避暑图","author":"张雨","text":"雪藕冰盘斫鲙厨，波光帘影带风蒲。\n苍生病渴无人问，赤日黄埃尽畏途。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10049,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"径山寺僧山水","author":"张雨","text":"澄心茧纸墨花香，上有元晖古印章。\n怪底径山山寺里，老僧衣袖著潇湘。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10050,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"白无咎黄蜀葵","author":"张雨","text":"金铜仙人雨中立，铅泪恰如辞汉时。\n倾心脉脉何所待，愿见白日光陆离。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10051,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"修竹士女图","author":"张雨","text":"空谷佳人玉佩珰，琅玕斜搭领襟长。\n杜陵野老多才思，解道风吹细细香。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10052,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"墨杏花折枝","author":"张雨","text":"折得邻墙红杏枝，春风偷染墨胭脂。\n恰如误入仙山路，虎啸林深月暗时。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10053,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"晋彦博士以诗索和甚愧率然观者勿笑其窘步","author":"张雨","text":"凿涧盛春雨，新流绕舍前。\n何当留太白，相与学思玄。\n碧洞无人扫，丹梯有路缘。\n催诗苦云迫，莫笑竦鸢肩。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10054,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"辅成观张上卿墓庐","author":"张雨","text":"青牛谢车御，白鹤叹人民。\n阁有凌烟像，桥无进履身。\n平生玉櫑具，此地石麒麟。\n荡荡传宗业，中朝倚外臣。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10055,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"风雪中得金陵诸公书二首 其一","author":"张雨","text":"雪作众禽惊，窗幽乱霰鸣。\n愕然身濩落，暮矣岁峥嵘。\n松竹聊娱拙，乾坤苦忌名。\n故人不相贷，书札到柴荆。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10056,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"风雪中得金陵诸公书二首 其二","author":"张雨","text":"落木从风靡，支流趁谷斜。\n山空不须说，岁去若为遮。\n饥鹤挦窗纸，寒鱼嚼雪花。\n推书更清坐，席暖到昏鸦。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10057,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"天谷庵","author":"张雨","text":"十三科取士，救世岂无方。\n倏送孤鸿举，难追八骏骧。\n金坛犹著号，碧落旧为郎。\n剑化丹垆在，山寒井水香。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10058,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"碧玉庵","author":"张雨","text":"廿四岩前客，能忘贺监居。\n乖龙嗔草檄，古象泣遗书。\n把袂风尘表，近公冰雪如。\n时来青琐闼，晚节要蘧庐。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10059,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"湖寺拥碧轩","author":"张雨","text":"喧寂一尘隔，湖滨出宝坊。\n荷阴分补衲，水气杂烧香。\n书勘乌皮几，茵敷白?床。\n从来已公屋，诗客许徜徉。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10060,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"万致柔还省亲舍仆闻而往候道中得此","author":"张雨","text":"数里平冈路，仙山迹渐分。\n柴荆来鹊语，村落去人群。\n粉阵松崩雪，涛头日濯云。\n不缘停仆御，直以候夫君。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10061,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄洞庭王子正","author":"张雨","text":"洞庭山似簇，银阙翠芙蓉。\n安得沧浪子，同寻缥缈峰。\n鱼龙随水落，橘柚待霜浓。\n未必桃源似，云帆蹑去踪。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10062,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"奉和揭学士听松轩","author":"张雨","text":"何年种松子，此地听松声。\n涛响风还作，山空夜自明。\n一瓢嫌物累，九奏感时清。\n得似苍髯叟，长依白玉生。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10063,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"孤山晚步寄和靖掌祠怀中庸子","author":"张雨","text":"玛瑙坡前立，荒陂接葑田。\n试从樵子径，往觅仆夫泉。\n众草寒犹短，群峰晚更妍。\n谁欤结真隐，共老太平年。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10064,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"十二月三日雪","author":"张雨","text":"快雪真无价，丰年定有期。\n腊前才一白，至后已多时。\n玉展琳琅步，花团蛱蝶枝。\n春风在天上，飘入万年池。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10065,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"煮石窝","author":"张雨","text":"仙人白石子，服食受奇方。\n王烈犹餐髓，初平枉叱羊。\n砂床收箭镞，玉屑备糇粮。\n借尔弥明鼎，行窝到处将。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10066,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"良常草堂图","author":"张雨","text":"邻近方隅洞，良常别有天。\n草堂朝看雨，药圃夜舂泉。\n邈矣卢鸿乙，奇哉鲁仲连。\n君看遗世者，若个是神仙。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10067,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"斋居偶兴","author":"张雨","text":"绝涧多灵石，中开小洞房。\n醉醒依竹素，晴雨看梅黄。\n树暗莺声涩，岩虚水韵长。\n未能超贾马，自足上羲皇。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10068,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"午日柬杨廉夫","author":"张雨","text":"客有拥琴至，吾宁折简招。\n足音垂谷口，雨气截山腰。\n酒倩红泉泻，花为绛节朝。\n不嫌泥泞极，一舸段家桥。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10069,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"雨中","author":"张雨","text":"推枕蘧然觉，高斋人迹稀。\n卷帘芳草短，看雨杏花肥。\n薄暮寒仍在，中林愿稍违。\n一迁随谷鸟，乔木是耶非。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10070,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"除夜","author":"张雨","text":"忽忽岁云暮，徒兴白首嗟。\n山留待伴雪，春禁隔年花。\n把卷因遮眼，分饧且胶牙。\n自缘身懒惰，莫遣送穷车。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10071,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"涧北梅□三月始华","author":"张雨","text":"阴涧残梅蘖，临流一向欹。\n但存孤注在，敢恨一生迟。\n冻雨如相喣，春寒不受吹。\n后时翻见独，宰物遂成私。","collection":"元","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10072,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"萼绿梅","author":"张雨","text":"山中古仙子，无言春寂寥。\n玉容澹朝雨，翠气湿微霄。\n临风怯玩影，弄雪妒攀条。\n拟觅何郎句，还凭翠袖招。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10073,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"山水便面为柳道传作","author":"张雨","text":"箧笥秋非远，尘埃暑实烦。\n遂游千里目，稍待一凉恩。\n僧阁依旁岭，渔梁跨别村。\n谁能从象外，试觅武陵源。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10074,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"马伯庸御史石田山房","author":"张雨","text":"监州遗爱地，御史读书堂。\n弦诵犹怀鲁，田园独在光。\n白茅编野屋，翠竹被溪梁。\n欲赋淮南隐，知君意不忘。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10075,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄樊子中打碑者","author":"张雨","text":"樊迟讵学圃，可论金石交。\n常赋旧文字，如见古陶匏。\n汉篆龙回壁，梁书室卧蛟。\n墨卿吾与尔，聊复隐三茅。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10076,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"呈揭曼硕学士","author":"张雨","text":"柴荆马粪间，蛛网动相关。\n阁老因移疾，鲰生赖订顽。\n雨凉新竹健，沙僻睡凫閒。\n如许清秋意，扁舟犹忍还。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10077,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"曲密亭","author":"张雨","text":"水盩山复屋，亭此可婆娑。\n蜗角地虽少，蜂房春自多。\n橘藏商皓乐，凤忆楚狂歌。\n何必天津上，远寻安乐窝。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10078,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"流杯涧","author":"张雨","text":"古木蟠幽涧，层峦叠翠台。\n水归苍玉峡，风引绿荷杯。\n我自知鱼乐，人谁祓禊来。\n惜无鼠须笔，写记刻岩隈。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10079,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"菌阁","author":"张雨","text":"岩架菌芝阁，榜题松雪扉。\n云来画檐宿，龙向墨池归。\n对几琴三叠，倚阑山四围。\n仙灵能夜降，应得㖟玄机。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10080,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"积雨","author":"张雨","text":"饱听三峰雨，閒题七月诗。\n水深荷意怯，田冷稻心迟。\n蛙黾阴争盛，蛟龙势亦随。\n苍茫不可问，身外付云移。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10081,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"早秋","author":"张雨","text":"每嫌新酒少，尚喜故交稠。\n篱落三家墅，梧桐十日秋。\n月生微顾兔，星淡没牵牛。\n亦欲观多稼，江湖雨未周。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10082,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵元镇玄文馆有怀","author":"张雨","text":"林气早知雨，黤淡研苔滋。\n素飙惊閒幔，朱实委清池。\n将整还山旆，复乱故园思。\n拿舟倘未远，弭棹一来兹。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10083,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"开元真人见贻刘商观弈图石刻毫发布缕皆尽精妙盖李龙眠临唐画本茅君彦模勒为玉局仙翁所藏云","author":"张雨","text":"薪桂苏兰者，能来立坐隅。\n徒闻玉楮刻，遂信石枰图。\n妙迹传仙李，高名重大苏。\n向来林下意，不敢易樵夫。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10084,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"乙亥元日试笔","author":"张雨","text":"自古三朝节，于今一笑看。\n问年书亥字，献岁出辛盘。\n黔突多蒸术，红冰剩浴丹。\n行行追胜事，步步埽春寒。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10085,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"无锡华子英溪山胜槩亭","author":"张雨","text":"共爱溪山住，输君胜槩多。\n疑将草堂画，展向镜湖波。\n鹳雀深松柏，凫鹥足芰荷。\n更修仁知术，乡社乐婆娑。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10086,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"蛛网落花","author":"张雨","text":"飞花堕锦茵，蛛网解留春。\n露垂沾更重，风破舞还频。\n不逐燕嘴泥，宁随马足尘。\n游丝复染惹，流浪何足嗔。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10087,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题墨兰赠别于一山之京师","author":"张雨","text":"三月愁送客，春寒雨如霰。\n冥冥返塞鸿，悄悄栖梁燕。\n扬帆五十日，蓬莱望中见。\n欲持猗兰操，一奏南薰殿。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10088,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"雪斋","author":"张雨","text":"骑驴吟雪诗，煮茶煎雪水。\n何如埽一室，置身虚白里。\n君家有故事，高卧殊未已。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10089,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"龙洞","author":"张雨","text":"山中春水泛，蜕骨长于树。\n拿舟探穴口，甚深不敢渡。\n穷冬桃始华，烂然珠光处。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10090,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"张师夔画谢家池塘","author":"张雨","text":"春风飒然至，幽人午梦醒。\n遥见池塘绿，不知春草生。\n如何骑马客，亦向梦中行。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10091,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"春山晴霭图","author":"张雨","text":"危亭面悬瀑，深坞著茅堂。\n群木相掩薄，风披如有香。\n避世真乐土，欲往川无梁。\n隐沦倘见招，岁莫从徜徉。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10092,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"兰雪斋为金坛王敬赋","author":"张雨","text":"谪仙有妙语，清风洒兰雪。\n高怀千载下，子独慕芳洁。\n春冰断瑞花，晨露滋奕叶。\n端居味道腴，光景庶不灭。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10093,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"再赋天池","author":"张雨","text":"巃嵷古墩邱，泓潭浸其股。\n金碧争荡磨，穿穴稍旁午。\n斩松罗石榻，玄芝错神浒。\n遥应玉女盆，润及黄精圃。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10094,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}}]